Step-by-step guides for common tasks:

- [Checked queries]($link.page('docs/guides/queries')): write queries as
  `.sql` files or Zig declarations and run them.
- [Migrations]($link.page('docs/guides/migrations')): lay out revisions that
  the checker replays into a schema.

Every guide has a runnable counterpart in
[`examples/`](https://github.com/westack-it/sqlz/tree/main/examples). Run one
with, for example, `zig build run-basic_sql_file`.
